{57}{The simplest way to describe the college of Meta is as a set of defensive magickal spells.  They are utilized for defending oneself against hostile magick, or for dispersing hostile magick that has been used upon something or someone.  I feel it is a must learn college for any "true" mage.}{The simplest way to describe the college of Meta is as a set of defensive magickal spells.  They are utilized for defending oneself against hostile magick, or for dispersing hostile magick that has been used upon something or someone.  I feel it is a must learn college for any "true" mage.}{}{}{}{lf2 1}
